Having regard to the facts and circumstances of the case, it is hereby ordered that out of total compensation amount, the amount is disbursed as follows :
(a) Petitioner No.1/Smt. Pinky (wife of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.19,14,180/- (Rupees Nineteen Lacs Fourteen Thousand One Hundred Eighty Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(b) Petitioner No.2/Yashika (daughter of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.10,00,000/- (Rupees Ten Lacs Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(c) Petitioner No.3/Krish (son of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.10,00,000/- (Rupees Ten Lacs Only) alongwith proportionate interest; Digitally signed SHIVAJI by SHIVAJI ANAND ANAND Date: 2024.08.09 16:31:10 +0530

